        "original_id": "a0a2bcb2-e604-5af2-9ce6-3605f4ae4448",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Microchip Technology, Keurig Green Mountain\n- Products: microcontrollers, memory semiconductors, analog semiconductors, coffeemakers\n- Topics: semiconductor product lines, specialty coffee\n\nFacts:\n- Keurig Green Mountain was founded in 1981 as Green Mountain Coffee Roasters and is a U.S.-headquartered specialty coffee and coffeemaker company.\n- Microchip Technology is an American manufacturer of microcontroller, memory, and analog semiconductors.\n- Microchip Technology products include microcontrollers such as PICmicro, dsPIC/PIC24, PIC32, AVR, AVR32, and SAM.\n- Microchip Technology products also include Serial EEPROM devices, Serial SRAM devices, KEELOQ devices, radio frequency devices, thermal analog devices, power and battery management analog devices, and linear, interface, and mixed signal devices.",
